.TH VALSPEAK 6.SH NAMEvalspeak \- translate text into Valley speak.SH SYNOPSIS\fBvalspeak\fR< infile.SH DESCRIPTIONA filter: it copies the standard input to the standard output in thevoice of a 1980s Valley girl, with interjections scattered at random, sothe same input comes out differently each time..nf    This is a really good computer, you know..ficomes back as.nf    Like, ya know, this is like, ya know, a totally bitchin'    computer, like, wow, you know..fi.SH SEE ALSOspew, newsgen